| !Run for !AddrSpace (what is using RISC OS's logical address space)
| Puts AddrSpace on the icon bar: Select on it opens its window.
Set AddrSpace$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <AddrSpace$Dir>.!Sprites

RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error AddrSpace needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error AddrSpace needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.

| AddrSpace's memory is all in its WimpSlot: it makes no dynamic area of
| its own, so it doesn't change what it shows. To log every change from
| the moment it starts (for example when it's started at boot):
| *Set AddrSpace$Log on before running it.
WimpSlot -min 512K -max 512K
Run <AddrSpace$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
